<del></del></span> Recommended Gear for Balance Druid in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="what-is-the-bis-balance-druid-gear">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="$color" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_misc_questionmark.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> What is the BiS Balance Druid gear?</h3>With many different sources of gearing and loot scarcity in Mists of Pandaria Classic, targeting your absolute best-in-slot gear isn't entirely realistic; instead, we've created a "best in slot" list from the ideal Balance Druid drops found in Phase 5 from raids, dungeons, reputation, and World Bosses to help you decide what to prioritize.<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>While raid drops are generally the most reliable way of getting high item level gear, many other items can be just as good, if not better, so you should reference the <a data-contiguous="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/guide/classes/druid/balance/dps-stat-priority-pve">Stat Priorities for Balance Druids</a> to help determine your own best-in-slot gear based on what is available to you.<ul class="exclude-units"></ul>
<br/>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="bis-gear">Overall Best-in-Slot Gear for Balance Druids</h3>This list represents the best overall gear available in Mists of Pandaria Classic Phase 4. The main aim is to reach 15% Hit, 10.3k Haste, and otherwise get as much Mastery as possible, while always using the highest item level you can find.<br/>
<br/>
