<del></del></span> Tier &amp; Set Bonuses for Balance Druid in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>Our set bonus going into phase 5 is very powerful. While the 2-piece is a minor DPS gain at most on single target, and does almost nothing on AoE, the 4-piece bonus is a very strong buff, helping us compensate for the loss of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=96558/unerring-vision-of-lei-shen">
<img alt="Unerring Vision of Lei Shen" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_hunter_focusedaim.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Unerring Vision of Lei Shen</span></a> and massively increasing our DPS on any form of Multi Dot Fight. This set bonus also rewards using "funnel" targets to help achieve more Shooting Star procs, so make sure to utilise off targets more.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="tier-16">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">Tier 16 -</span></h3>
