<del></del></span> Emperor Shaohao</span></h3>
<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>
<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>Emperor Shaohao is a new faction introduced on the Timeless Isle.  This faction is purely for vanity loot only.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="crafted-gear">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c11" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_chest_cloth_challengepriest_d_01.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Crafted Gear for Balance Druid</span></h3>Crafted items are no longer restricted by your Profession option, except for Engineering, so this allows us to equip Leatherworking items without Leatherworking if we need to. With <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=6738/siege-of-orgrimmar">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Siege of Orgrimmar</span></a> release, the new crafted items can be accessed through raid drops and will be quite expensive due to their large material requirements.<br/>
<br/>The following crafted items are all workable up til you have access to better gear from Heroic Siege of Orgrimmar and should be used if you either have an excess of materials or gold to spend at the Auction House.<ul class="last">
